OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers this evening, some heavy with
OL,7,Fchance of thunder.
OL,8,
OL,9,CThursday:FMainly dry start but some
OL,10,Fearly showers in far south. A few
OL,11,Fsunny intervals, then some showers
OL,12,Freturning in the afternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,15,Fdry, quite cloudy but some sunny
OL,16,Fintervals. Saturday dry with some
OL,17,Fsunshine. Sunday mainly cloudy perhaps
OL,18,Fsome patchy light rain.
